  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWinForms 0.1.0-preview.33 with immutable LibreWPF 0.1.0-preview.33 and ProGPU 0.1.0-preview.29, including the typed transparent-window state contract; persists versioned, bounded designer SerializationStore payloads and content component collections across save/load cycles; inherits the native Windows OLE clipboard round-trip path and macOS owner-surface popup interaction policy; builds unchanged .NET WinForms template projects through LibreWinForms.Sdk without requiring a Windows TFM; preserves Project Explorer and designer double-click counts; keeps MenuStrip, ToolStrip, context menus, and dropdowns correctly positioned and interactive; and retains typed X11/XWayland positioning, movement, dispatcher-pump, bounded-memory, text, image, and scene-performance behavior.",
